f a TESTER."},{"k":"p","t":"Disconnect the power supply before inserting or removing the P.C. board."}]},{"n":6,"words":267,"heads":[{"t":"MOON CRESTA","lvl":1},{"t":"HOW TO PL","lvl":2}],"blocks":[{"k":"h","t":"MOON CRESTA"},{"k":"h","t":"HOW TO PL"},{"k":"p","t":"The war has began from Galaxy to Galaxy. The almighty ALIENS are advancing to planet Earth. The horrific battle is with us. COLD-EYE will distract them divide when wounded, SUPER-FLY is testing our weaponry systems, as FOUR-D and METEOR are directing punishing attacks and ATOMIC-PILE will surely destroy us. Wave after wave they increace their fearsome invasion. Earth\u2019s only weapon capable of success is MOON CRESTA a three stage MULTI-FIRE rocket."},{"k":"p","t":"SCORE"},{"k":"p","t":"Cold Eye Super Fly Four-D Meteor Atomic Pile"},{"k":"p","t":"5OPcinss \u201430Points \u00a9 \u2014\u00bb\u00abGOPoints \u00a9 + ZOD Points \u00a9 100Points \u00a9"},{"k":"p","t":"PLAYING RULES If you complete 2 or 3 stage docking successfully,"},{"k":"li","t":"* The game may be played by 1 or 2 people. you will have MULTI-FIRE power."},{"k":"li","t":"* Insert coin."},{"k":"li","t":"* Select 1 or 2 player button."},{"k":"li","t":"* Shoot down the attacking enemy by pushing the firing button, slide the ROCKET to the right or left by moving the control lever."},{"k":"li","t":"* Extra ROCKETS (No. 1, 2, 3) will be awarded if the score gained exceeds the pre-set points."},{"k":"li","t":"* The game is over when all ROCKETS have been destroyed."},{"k":"li","t":"* You can leave your name (5 highest scores) on the screen to register your success (MIN.5000 pts.) against the invading aliens. Docking"},{"k":"li","t":"* The object of the mission is to succeed in docking the first stage ROCKET with the 2nd and 3rd stage."},{"k":"li","t":"* The highest score is obtained by completing the docking operation in the shortest time."},{"k":"li","t":"* When the docking is successfully completed a high rate of fire will produce a high score. T